10.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>老药</category><category>珍珠粉</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事——犀牛角的奥秘</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-%E7%8A%80%E7%89%9B%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%A5%E7%A7%98/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 15 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-%E7%8A%80%E7%89%9B%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%A5%E7%A7%98/</guid><description>自老安宫停产后，每年拍卖行的老安宫都逐年水涨船高。目前每次拍卖行都在好几十万一颗，一般成交的都是犀角的安宫。 犀角的产地一般有爪哇的，早已绝迹</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%20%e7%8a%80%e7%89%9b%e8%a7%92%e7%9a%84%e5%a5%a5%e7%a7%98.assets/image-20240317163631229.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>安宫牛黄丸</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之十香返魂丹</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%8D%81%E9%A6%99%E8%BF%94%E9%AD%82%E4%B8%B9/</link><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 13 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%8D%81%E9%A6%99%E8%BF%94%E9%AD%82%E4%B8%B9/</guid><description>月支神香·返魂香 十香返生丸，古清代孟文瑞《春脚集》卷三有“十香返魂丹”一方。2000年版《中国药典》中收载，原方由天然麝香、天然牛黄等诸多名</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%e5%8d%81%e9%a6%99%e8%bf%94%e9%ad%82%e4%b8%b9.assets/640-1705196200558-68.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>十香返魂丹</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之----中药急救第二宝</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B----%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E6%80%A5%E6%95%91%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%9D/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 10 Dec 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B----%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E6%80%A5%E6%95%91%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%9D/</guid><description>✨ 安宫牛黄丸&amp;ndash;唯一的特效药 百药之王百宝丹 安宫的小故事 中药急救有三宝，排名第一是老安宫牛黄丸，第二是老紫雪散，第三是老百宝丹。 其实</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b----%e4%b8%ad%e8%8d%af%e6%80%a5%e6%95%91%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%ae%9d.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>紫雪散</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之健步虎潜丸</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%81%A5%E6%AD%A5%E8%99%8E%E6%BD%9C%E4%B8%B8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 16 Nov 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%81%A5%E6%AD%A5%E8%99%8E%E6%BD%9C%E4%B8%B8/</guid><description>健步虎潜丸，中医方剂名，出自《伤科补要》卷三。 1993年是最后一批原方原药，目前算是天花板级别的收藏类老药，里面含原方中的虎骨。如今虽有些替</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%e5%81%a5%e6%ad%a5%e8%99%8e%e6%bd%9c%e4%b8%b8.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>虎潜丸</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之431号绝密——国家一级保密配方</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B431%E5%8F%B7%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%86-%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 25 Oct 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B431%E5%8F%B7%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%86-%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9/</guid><description>接上期：老药的故事之——季德胜蛇药 序 夜聊对话 昨晚，邓公跟我聊了一晚上。 大家都不年轻了，也很少能聊到一块，都经历了从年轻到半百。老小子比我长些</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e5%ad%a3%e5%be%b7%e8%83%9c%e8%9b%87%e8%8d%af.assets/640-1698028964602-34.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>蛇药</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之——季德胜蛇药</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E5%AD%A3%E5%BE%B7%E8%83%9C%E8%9B%87%E8%8D%AF/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 21 Oct 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E5%AD%A3%E5%BE%B7%E8%83%9C%E8%9B%87%E8%8D%AF/</guid><description>两个缘起 写下这篇蛇药的介绍有两个缘起。 第一个：前不久，有位21岁女孩被一条银环蛇咬了。因为当时没找到对应的血清，错过了最佳治疗时间死了。其实</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e5%ad%a3%e5%be%b7%e8%83%9c%e8%9b%87%e8%8d%af.assets/640-1698028964602-34.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>蛇药</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之 —— 男性之宝</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E7%94%B7%E6%80%A7%E4%B9%8B%E5%AE%9D/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 05 Oct 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E7%94%B7%E6%80%A7%E4%B9%8B%E5%AE%9D/</guid><description>中年之后，人体逐步进入衰退。 中医的精髓在于保养，其次是治疗，所以我一般都是建议两者同步。我姑且叫它阴阳互调，意思是无论治病还是养生，都要兼顾</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e7%94%b7%e6%80%a7%e4%b9%8b%e5%ae%9d.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>男性</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之——神奇的小金丹</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E9%87%91%E4%B8%B9/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 20 Sep 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E9%87%91%E4%B8%B9/</guid><description>01 小金丹的来历及其主治功效 以丹来命名的方子并不多，小金丹算一个。丹乃精炼之意，而金则是为了凸显其珍贵。小金丹出自清代名医王洪绪的《外科证治全</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%e2%80%94%e2%80%94%e7%a5%9e%e5%a5%87%e7%9a%84%e5%b0%8f%e9%87%91%e4%b8%b9.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>小金丹</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之 —— 中药界的抗生素</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E7%95%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E7%94%9F%E7%B4%A0/</link><pubDate>Sat, 02 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 02 Sep 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E7%95%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E7%94%9F%E7%B4%A0/</guid><description>壹 中药抗生素 一说到抗生素，很多人的第一反应就是想到西药。其实中药界也有，就是六神丸。 在古代还没有西药抗生素的年代，它就发挥了抗生素的作用，甚</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e2%80%94%e2%80%94%20%e4%b8%ad%e8%8d%af%e7%95%8c%e7%9a%84%e6%8a%97%e7%94%9f%e7%b4%a0.assets/640-1694025260277-36.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>六神丸</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之——妇科良药</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E5%A6%87%E7%A7%91%E8%89%AF%E8%8D%AF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 27 Aug 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E5%A6%87%E7%A7%91%E8%89%AF%E8%8D%AF/</guid><description>80年代，有颗药丸卖到4元多，一盒24元，而当时老干部的月收入才36元。到底什么药如此昂贵？它是何方圣物？下面我来做个介绍。 圣药 • 传承至今 1</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e5%a6%87%e7%a7%91%e8%89%af%e8%8d%af.assets/624c0f5e7022160142c7f8773b003772.jpg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>妇科</category><category>定坤丹</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之——国家七大中药绝密配方</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 27 Jul 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E7%BB%9D%E5%AF%86%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9/</guid><description>传统中药材、方剂汗牛充栋，具体来说有一万多种中药材、四千多种中药制剂，但被列为永久和长期“国家绝密或保密”配方的只有七种。 这七种药的待遇很特</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%e2%80%94%e2%80%94%e5%9b%bd%e5%ae%b6%e4%b8%83%e5%a4%a7%e4%b8%ad%e8%8d%af%e7%bb%9d%e5%af%86%e9%85%8d%e6%96%b9.assets/640-1690554668267-6.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药故事之 —— 中药抗癌第一药</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E6%8A%97%E7%99%8C%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%8D%AF/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 11 Jul 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E4%B8%AD%E8%8D%AF%E6%8A%97%E7%99%8C%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%8D%AF/</guid><description>中国近些年来癌症患者越来越多，据统计目前中国每天有超过一万人被确诊为癌症。近些年随着人们生活习惯的改变，癌症日益年轻化，中年以上患癌症的概率</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e4%b8%ad%e8%8d%af%e6%8a%97%e7%99%8c%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e8%8d%af.assets/640-1689696640238-18.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>犀黄丸</category><category>癌症</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之——百药之王：百宝丹</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E7%99%BE%E8%8D%AF%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%8B-%E7%99%BE%E5%AE%9D%E4%B8%B9/</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 23 Jun 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E7%99%BE%E8%8D%AF%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%8B-%E7%99%BE%E5%AE%9D%E4%B8%B9/</guid><description>民国时期的曲焕章被誉为中药制剂巨匠，他成功研制出了被誉为功效十全、百药之王的百宝丹。它颠覆了我们仅仅认为百宝丹只能做外伤药的认识。 研制过程 有</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e7%99%be%e8%8d%af%e4%b9%8b%e7%8e%8b%20%e7%99%be%e5%ae%9d%e4%b8%b9.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>百宝丹</category><category>云南白药</category><category>外伤</category><category>癌症</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>老药的故事之—— 宫廷圣药：梅花点舌丹，救命宝丹</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E5%AE%AB%E5%BB%B7%E5%9C%A3%E8%8D%AF-%E6%A2%85%E8%8A%B1%E7%82%B9%E8%88%8C%E4%B8%B9-%E6%95%91%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9D%E4%B8%B9/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 15 Jun 2023 21:03:47 -0500</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/health-product/%E8%80%81%E8%8D%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E4%B9%8B-%E5%AE%AB%E5%BB%B7%E5%9C%A3%E8%8D%AF-%E6%A2%85%E8%8A%B1%E7%82%B9%E8%88%8C%E4%B8%B9-%E6%95%91%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9D%E4%B8%B9/</guid><description>梅花点舌丹是宫廷圣药，出自清代宫廷秘方，有“灵丹”的美誉，可以治疗五大疾病。 红楼梦第42回 “蘅芜君兰言解疑癖，潇湘子雅谑补余香”中，刘姥姥返</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%80%81%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e6%95%85%e4%ba%8b%e4%b9%8b%20%e5%ae%ab%e5%bb%b7%e5%9c%a3%e8%8d%af%20%e6%a2%85%e8%8a%b1%e7%82%b9%e8%88%8c%e4%b8%b9%20%e6%95%91%e5%91%bd%e5%ae%9d%e4%b8%b9.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>梅花点舌丹</category><category>癌症</category><category>老药</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item></channel></rss>